---
import Section from '../layouts/Section.astro';
import { h } from '../data/site';
import { work } from '../data/pages';
---
<Section
  page={4}
  title="Work"
  intro="What I’ve worked on, and what I’m currently working on."
  mirror
  heads={[h('orangutan'), h('macacus-libidinosus'), h('red-tailed-monkey'), h('silvery-marmoset'), h('lhoests-monkey'), h('hamadryas-baboon'), h('andaman-macaque'), h('tufted-capuchin'), h('grey-woolly-monkey'), h('red-shanked-douc')]}
>
  <div class="bio">
  <p>I graduate in May 2027, and I’m looking for full-time roles where I can keep building. That means product and strategy roles at startups, especially in payments, fintech and AI; founder’s associate and business operations roles, close to the people running the company; and investing roles at venture or growth funds that back those kinds of companies.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="list">
    {work.map((w) => (
      <li class="work-item">
        <div>
          <span class="meta">{w.meta}</span>
          <span class="item-title">{w.title}</span>
          <span class="item-about">{w.about}</span>
          <ul class="bullets">{w.bullets.map((b) => <li>{b}</li>)}</ul>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</Section>
